      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON SICILY (5) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 19.93 with a 9 length win at this track over 350m. Got the money at his only try from this box. Can make it back-to-back wins. RAKIN' IT IN (3) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Maiden H win two back (24.23) at this track. Expected to bounce back to best. CARPARK BABE (7) is having her first start around this track. Comes here a last start placegetter at Mt Gambier in a Grade 6/MDN (17.53). Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Overdue and expected to feature again. RUNWAY STORM (8) picked up a cheque in slick time most recently - in the mix again.",
